    "body": "The tag in rel-tag is defined as the last path component of the URL. If you want it to have spaces and slashes in, you need to escape them. \n\n> the last segment of the path portion of the URI (after the final \"/\" character) contains the tag value\n\nfrom http://microformats.org/wiki/rel-tag\n",
