    "updated_at": "2015-11-26T08:22:03Z",
    "body": "I'm not sure if software still parses tags that way so the point about\nspaces may be less germane. However the 'last path segment is the tag' is\npretty universal, even if underscores and dashes are more commonly used\nthan %20 for spaces in tags now.\n\nPicking an example that references an actual tagspace rather than using\nwikipedia may be a better resolution.\n",
